@CLTTestApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036
@ApiKey = clt-demo-api-key-2026

### Crear usuario
POST {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "email": "juan@test.com"
}

### Listar usuarios (sin filtro)
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar usuarios activos
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users?isActive=true
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Obtener usuario por id
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar usuario
PUT {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@test.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Eliminar usuario
DELETE {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users/1
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

### Crear dirección
POST {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users/1/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "street": "Calle Falsa 123",
  "city": "Asunción",
  "country": "Paraguay",
  "zipCode": "9999"
}

### Listar direcciones del usuario
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/users/1/addresses
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Actualizar dirección
PUT {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/addresses/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "street": "Av. Mcal. López 456",
  "city": "Asunción",
  "country": "Paraguay",
  "zipCode": "1234"
}

### Eliminar dirección
DELETE {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/addresses/1
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

### Listar monedas
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/currencies
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear moneda
POST {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/currencies
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "code": "EUR",
  "name": "Euro",
  "rateToBase": 7900
}

### Convertir moneda
POST {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/currency/convert
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "fromCurrencyCode": "USD",
  "toCurrencyCode": "PYG",
  "amount": 100
}

### Sin API Key (debe devolver 401)
GET {{CLTTestApi_HostAddress}}/currencies
Accept: application/json
